{"parents": [], "prev": null, "next": {"link": "client/", "title": "DocWorm Client"}, "title": "docworm", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"docworm\">\n<h1>docworm<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#docworm\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Python SDK for the DocWorm service: document indexing, knowledge graphs, reasoning RAG,\nand chat.</p>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"client/\">DocWorm Client</a><ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"client/#docworm.client.DocWorm\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DocWorm</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"models/\">Data Models</a><ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"models/#docworm.models.CitedNode\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">CitedNode</span></code></a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"models/#docworm.models.UsageInfo\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">UsageInfo</span></code></a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"models/#docworm.models.ChatEvent\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ChatEvent</span></code></a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"models/#docworm.models.UploadResponse\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">UploadResponse</span></code></a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"models/#docworm.models.IndexResponse\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">IndexResponse</span></code></a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l2\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"models/#docworm.models.DocumentStatus\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DocumentSta